      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:39": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9fac88110ff1da01b54e78188e0f382c09d20a94e9b7763b3ac92fac9579dbcf",
      "en": "「To be a true champion of justice...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:76": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "41a0508efc186beac33aa82ed7bea54cf91121552932d2bf9eb51d1f9049fc9a",
      "en": "「Now $$ノノ$$ has become a $$バスターマシン$$\\nin both heart and body!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:137": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9019c5942d606fce5321f76a0e32f5c07285fafaa95875429dc487b1368546bb",
      "en": "「Now I can understand\\n$$ノノリリ$$'s feelings!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:186": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9220d495fce36f53328a4c8b083a2490b1747e2d5ef6e50f9ec112e67542e07c",
      "en": "「The bond with Big Sis\\nis the source of $$ノノ$$'s power!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:235": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b258af784c9b7a551b4e1bb5e00405d64b6929bea734ca4471ccc5d7a2c61296",
      "en": "「This power exists\\nto protect the people I love!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:288": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9e2abf23899cf206f7761b2e58d7861411518eb3948ca27949393e4baeef80f2",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will protect humanity!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:321": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d10e1be880ffe1c04b32b4b6c9ed19d71780537e51d16e384283e0753835463c",
      "en": "「Now is the time to show\\n$$バスターマシン$$ power!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:370": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f71a8fa8dbbb3b87ad644b722a2aa2a0f98053d6b58fb87df7e0acf6c201d934",
      "en": "「Protecting Big Sis...!\\nProtecting everyone is $$ノノ$$'s duty!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:427": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "51bf205cdf54125f87c2f5e4e26252534de8913fbca8d75d1bbfbc040c76a58d",
      "en": "「Hard work and guts!\\nThat's the power of $$バスターマシン$$s!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:484": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "96de266ae1a67a2b5008d5d7079e11a66e3342ef0a5c75ebb6e02bfa47322e05",
      "en": "「I don't fight to defeat anything...!\\nI fight to protect something!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:555": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "127a7fbb238eb95f655e5dc049db6099a909c13578620205d627034f1d59fb34",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will do what a\\n$$バスターマシン$$ must do!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:612": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3974b2c44c9d4e74a90d3dc47416a1afb251de3af10500a2ded7000d7788843e",
      "en": "「A red body is a sign of justice...!\\n$$ダイバスター$$ is here!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:665": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2093c4b80882f964933d269a24eefcd9deef472b4372dc13bc4623e8fe5d34fe",
      "en": "「The united power of the\\n$$バスター軍団$$...! I'll show you!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:724": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1d628a46c255bac72cbda9cd83b916c5d912e7ab6db3613a73fb61d741d54fb1",
      "en": "「With everyone's hearts as one,\\nI'll make a miracle happen!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:787": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "36ac6422131014e99e2ecc78a5a3a519dced4605709fa8faa11e4c0071d1f512",
      "en": "「I will protect humanity's future...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:824": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a8365c3f2fd13cd8a65a1b6c8865fe38f520edd405cc285b37deb8a44ae7bf29",
      "en": "「Buster Machine No. 3 is\\nhumanity's hope!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:873": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d676b1b1672dc27b7adf8dcb828b78315e40039a9ef1ac63cae334f6a49572ab",
      "en": "「Hopes passed down from ages past...!\\nI'll protect them!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:932": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9bc9398f00809f77634d9408039ea76dcefd70c276f76159269159e600804d96",
      "en": "「The Earth $$ノノリリ$$ protected...!\\nNext, $$ノノ$$ will protect it!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:987": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b9820da2dce192012df02ec135abd5655836dc2be6cbcb979e358e5ad0638114",
      "en": "「Earth, the place I promised Big Sis!\\nI'll definitely protect it!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1042": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "57125f13670074465977b2de83876dd9dec3fa5f836d3164e1e645b98333f4f1",
      "en": "「Not yet! It isn't over yet!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_01"
    },
    "160:1083": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1024c00a9038917cc1f7ae996a55d7b17c6e245706d383b3d81ae893e3669c5c",
      "en": "「Can't down it in one? Once more!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_01"
    },
    "160:1122": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9bcf9acec65e5790ed83f0377ab11d15f979112b23758662ddc53889eab2a44c",
      "en": "「$$タイタン変動重力源$$! Prepare yourself!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1163": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "51fd1d2cb699f416794d05e8826f4424e9caf0063ee4b2bf1dfd9d02830f07bf",
      "en": "「Space monster survivors $$ノノリリ$$ fought...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1206": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c487d58b5ebbc85eda11a2401d6348160a6146173677ccc8d6d38eee42d065a2",
      "en": "「The fight with the $$宇宙怪獣$$\\nends here!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1257": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1de57f6f08651a59a5c970021d2e8fd0f2bd874f3a81ac3d5cdbe6128d138516",
      "en": "「$$エグゼリオ変動重力源$$!\\nNow is the time to settle this!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1310": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ecdda2f762f95bb7e108335ff7594c3f818fa4a2f3f1b16e8f18d1fa17c7d6ce",
      "en": "「If space monsters are our bane,\\nthen $$ノノ$$ is theirs!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1371": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f1028537b3beb0b431bea2acb22933833fa43a3c09369e8742d97483e073d646",
      "en": "「Guard humanity from space monsters!\\nThat is $$ノノ$$'s mission!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1430": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "65d04d1f45b4b77fc3d60b5e3e50981dab4c108a6947814f15fdd6ecb0cb5c60",
      "en": "「I remember now\\nwho I'm truly meant to fight!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1485": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "050a9e25e4c9cb3ec610e502509db5cd4b37a0ec8e314076d31664bec62ac180",
      "en": "「Humanity's foes, Angels too, are $$ノノ$$'s foes!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1528": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2f469aede180ba3be0770d8a17b5f2a6694a23699812ab4e929c7dd32ae6678d",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will fight the despair shards\\nthat the $$アンチスパイラル$$ left!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1593": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c691620ccc2edb80edb045c6b0c04d64c4bd09f43b2b29378c7606e15404105a",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will stop that unit's movement!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1626": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2c3a51a21588b7c120b6a0aae4680fd99b8f3ee5d7d2a8d61084684e07a2e361",
      "en": "「We'll all save you! Without fail!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1669": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9f79911398dd8dbbe0a22c8ddc62135aeb41f2d257c1d997ab0f25f1d200b905",
      "en": "「Machines have hearts too,\\nand you mustn't lose yours!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1726": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f92024273b3d8e9011181781af202e058ffaa16554257d2057b7253fc82368fe",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$, a machine like you,\\nwill teach you a heart of justice!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1779": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ca46668b4bbdc2eefdf6ac1b3089c7e1610e5fe8b406788f8277e81dbdc7a43f",
      "en": "「I'll free you from\\nthe Lieutenant Colonel's wishes!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1828": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e5ab4b8abbd68753d756d8ff9c29b9fc140e7e0bb7b7507f44f73c1bed3c17cd",
      "en": "「Please leave!\\nOtherwise I'll destroy your unit!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1887": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e4d5fc851482919702d89a54ab1f3a2bf325c07b5d0b58309e5e4cddd1a02557",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$'s foe is battle itself!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1928": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c36675ab29875a884d87bb95c243cd8be51880ddb02e401cddfe6cfbc75ccb92",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will fight anything that comes\\nto Earth with malice!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:1981": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "439a295322899e68244220c295300ac8114c6fd86e302625a93e57d7217b9641",
      "en": "「Remember this!\\nEarth has Buster Machines!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2046": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "7a77e0f34a3b4524c3b12145b2a7fb4c8b877156f57aea4cd8ef855e601717fc",
      "en": "「I'll stop the Angel of destruction!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2079": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "896cb5227404f350a843797b765a942e49f4d86226882f3656b559b30a3dbef5",
      "en": "「That's enough of your rampage!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2122": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "432c5ec5b9bca2d1c9e932c31b08192756d25fa6742f87e3d2abaafde2c758ed",
      "en": "「$$バスターマシン$$s are the swords\\nof those without power!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2177": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ea9156c3254246cd7699621816d6ae8b1d6f71663e9cc5cceb788c37d49d455b",
      "en": "「$$バスターマシン$$s fight anything\\nthat threatens humanity!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2230": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d2a268e2cdb01de8e37a0a86544080c6c27fba4428a59128d2b3e6578510dc46",
      "en": "「Whoever you are,\\nI will carry justice through!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2281": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "da86702bbcdec705ac69781516fa94b6fe4d272231494cd5a7540e23931dd8be",
      "en": "「An ideal won by war has no justice!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2322": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6a278ccbe6328b557dd6c329728b4589bb9b072364bbbd7e9d8147e885b6bf68",
      "en": "「I'll defeat the root of evil here!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2355": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d97873b88bc827696b4a229f8bfdbbd6d3f38f040fe715cd1ec6fc4563b549cb",
      "en": "「Humanity has the will and resolve\\nto fight!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2404": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8da9042b84896bae66450c1407895f1bec1f4fa5e873d8a41b6a0e0074477122",
      "en": "「For peace, $$ノノ$$ fights to the end!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2447": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "be02f791288dacd1b139a163d5925efdb002848e3168cf3ce6ee157e936bf2b5",
      "en": "「I'll take Earth back, absolutely!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2484": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "10abb7442edee3e6f1c9b95c04a5d77b6b7fe61722f7ae3638fed55d5cd0add0",
      "en": "「$$サイデリアル$$ are foes of all humanity!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2525": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "49b61a3d95f36f416936d6b33c6f54123b56a8dda586112d17f885714f08aa32",
      "en": "「$$スフィア$$s aren't a power meant\\nto be used for such things!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2588": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "567905b29b8362ec3ed8756db66f934a50c55f8811f6e7db26a07f7f21c50e9b",
      "en": "「$$アウストラリス$$!\\nYour days as emperor end today!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2645": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3545706257936ed0f805079171819c8a6bd294a37422a63a2230d1a3db5b29a1",
      "en": "「You and $$ノノ$$!\\n$$次元獣$$ vs. $$バスター軍団$$!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2702": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "14e0e69ceffda90aada9224320200386239b86a4ed96672d579a1d75edf8c849",
      "en": "「Even if you live for eternity,\\nyou must never lose your heart!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2761": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1a30c1c2e62f81f5fa59880c73be9eafd3c8048ec53d286833655ec34ba3dcc9",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will break through\\nthe darkness in your heart!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2814": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b181dda32634b93090563bce9414a46a4d985fbf7219809863b33c61a032b138",
      "en": "「$$バスターマシン$$s fight everything\\nthat steals humanity's future!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2873": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2994cc298a283b1fc142e9d18c23f0a16c1bbdf90c3a296294efe8f6e2106304",
      "en": "「You who steal the future and hope\\naren't emissaries of God!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2942": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8ce913afb89d125b2e8ad3b65e111d75385e6aea873a52dfa4146d7070522993",
      "en": "「The goddess of victory won't smile\\non those who fight only in anger!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:2995": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b640ef4ce7b71aceed0497868713baeaef587344610e902d926604a53b0bb695",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ will never accept\\nwhat you think is fun!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:3052": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e3dcf6fc9b1488d755533190a5d18ffc41d592af721d4ed55a6004e8604a08a0",
      "en": "「True joy belongs not to one person,\\nbut is something to be shared!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:3117": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "7675bb36126b72a14c04db6a989b14c33aa01c898fa54f4af99ecbe773d30464",
      "en": "「Your joy is something\\nonly you can rejoice in!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:3170": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "840545a1c297fb73e7767b1b053a14d327480adf22d3799455a3ca2f671eeb86",
      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ won't accept anyone who\\nmakes others sacrifice with a smile!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:3231": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "842baa68525700c3279c25ddca26a4e1490882ab5922e7b92aef0ff0e74ce0c5",
      "en": "「For all worlds' future and peace,\\n$$ノノ$$ will beat you!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:3296": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "94c686248fadbae0085f9aac83965dbace432115ec80df5b1d5f8ca693a70128",
      "en": "「You should trust not the $$御使い$$s,\\nbut yourselves!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
    "160:3357": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "58e0d40ace6867d7ff5e589d45127f7ab8f6e0d93e7afc94514e311ca17a937c",
      "en": "「You are people who threw away\\nthe future to survive!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g160_00"
    },
